"Project) manual, or to send additions or changes, please send "
"email/patches to the Yocto Project documentation mailing list at "
"``docs@lists.yoctoproject.org`` or log into the `Libera Chat "
"<https://libera.chat/>`__ ``#yocto`` channel."
